<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <style>
            body {
                font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
                background: #f5f5f7;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .wrap {
                max-width: 520px;
                margin: 40px auto;
                background: #fff;
                border-radius: 14px;
                overflow: hidden;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            }

            .header {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #534AB7 100%);
                padding: 40px 32px;
                text-align: center;
            }

                .header h1 {
                    color: #fff;
                    font-size: 24px;
                    margin: 0 0 8px;
                    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
                }

                .header p {
                    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 15px;
                }

            .body {
                padding: 32px;
            }

                .body h2 {
                    color: #1a1a2e;
                    font-size: 18px;
                    margin: 0 0 16px;
                }

                .body p {
                    color: #555;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    margin: 0 0 16px;
                }

            .features {
                margin: 24px 0;
            }

            .feature {
                margin: 12px 0;
                padding: 12px;
                background: #f5f5f7;
                border-left: 4px solid #534AB7;
            }

                .feature strong {
                    color: #1a1a2e;
                }

            .footer {
                background: #fafafa;
                padding: 20px 32px;
                text-align: center;
                border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            }

                .footer p {
                    font-size: 12px;
                    color: #aaa;
                    margin: 0;
                }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class='wrap'>
        <div class='header'>
            <h1>Welcome to ShopEase!</h1>
            <p>Your account has been created successfully</p>
        </div>
        <div class='body'>
            <p>Hi <strong>{{Name}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>Welcome to ShopEase! We're excited to have you on board. Your account is now active and ready to use.</p>

            <h2>What you can do:</h2>
            <div class='features'>
                <div class='feature'>
                    <strong>🛍️ Browse Products</strong> — Explore millions of products across all categories
                </div>
                <div class='feature'>
                    <strong>📦 Easy Ordering</strong> — Fast checkout and secure payment options
                </div>
                <div class='feature'>
                    <strong>🚚 Track Delivery</strong> — Real-time tracking for your orders
                </div>
                <div class='feature'>
                    <strong>💰 Great Deals</strong> — Exclusive offers and discounts for members
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team. We're here to help!</p>
            <p>Happy shopping!</p>
        </div>
        <div class='footer'>
            <p>&copy; {{Year}} ShopEase. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
